"NotProton is free; CrossOver needs activation. This app requires macOS 26 or later. Exact supported builds are listed in Status." = "NotProton is free; CrossOver needs activation. This app requires macOS 26 or later. Exact supported builds are listed in Status.";
"Open Privacy & Security → App Management. Enable the NotProton app you are using if it is listed. NotProton cannot reliably read whether this permission has been granted." = "Open Privacy & Security → App Management. Enable the NotProton app you are using if it is listed. NotProton cannot reliably read whether this permission has been granted.";
"Steam may later request Input Monitoring for controllers. Full Disk Access is not a general setup requirement." = "Steam may later request Input Monitoring for controllers. Full Disk Access is not a general setup requirement.";
