"Use the macOS Steam app. In Library, open the game's Properties → Compatibility, enable Force the use of a specific Steam Play compatibility tool, then choose the installed NotProton / CrossOver tool from the dropdown. This is Steam's Compatibility page, not macOS Accessibility settings. Restart Steam after adding a runtime. You do not need Windows Steam in a separate bottle." = "Use the macOS Steam app. In Library, open the game's Properties → Compatibility, enable Force the use of a specific Steam Play compatibility tool, then choose the installed NotProton / CrossOver tool from the dropdown. This is Steam's Compatibility page, not macOS Accessibility settings. Restart Steam after adding a runtime. You do not need Windows Steam in a separate bottle.";
